+# T8132-specific platform support UEFI package
+
+## About
+
+This package provides platform-specific code for all machines that use an M4 SoC, 
+internally H14S/H14C or Donan. Mainly for SoC specific ACPI tables, all platforms can share the same tables
+because all Donan chip variants are the same platform internally just with different configurations from the factory.
